{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile multimodal setup with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, comparing it to the PCA encoder used in config_004. Validation accuracy improved slightly (0.6315 vs 0.6186), but F1 decreased marginally (0.6068 vs 0.6103), suggesting potential trade-offs. The exact contribution of the RNA encoder choice versus other design elements remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

